flowchart TD
  Y[YouTube root comments and replies] --> S[Immutable source registry and parent context]
  S --> D[Sol discovery and candidate consolidation]
  D --> E[Embeddings retrieve candidate-source pairs]
  E --> M[Jev membership observations]
  M --> V[Sol independent membership verification]
  V --> N[Host seeded membership eligibility: minimum one source]
  N --> C[Sol core type and source-fidelity checks]
  C --> F[Sol source graph and candidate certificates]
  F --> T[Sol document-based fact checks when supplied]
  P[Prepared topic documents and exact passages] --> T
  T --> H[Host source eligibility and essential dependency checks]
  H --> A[Explicit seeded policy: at least one verified source]
  P --> A
  A --> B[Immutable perspective bundle and actual source count]
  B --> R[Conversation controller and isolated history]
  U[User question or peer discussion context] --> R
  R --> Q[Host reserves generation plus verification budget]
  Q --> G[Sol writes bounded proposed paragraphs]
  P --> G
  G --> J[Jev observes named paragraph targets in one request]
  J --> K[Host publishes eligible paragraphs and exact citations]
  K --> O[Original comment-backed claims]
  K --> I[AI reasoning: zero new comment support]
  K --> X[External evidence: bound document passages]
  O --> UI[Stored one-to-one or group messages and provenance UI]
  I --> UI
  X --> UI
  K --> L[Explanatory abstention stays abstention]
  L --> UI
